WEBVTT

00:01:28.320 --> 00:01:36.910 line:0%
[Melody of Golden Age]

00:01:36.950 --> 00:01:39.880 line:0%
[Episode 26]

00:01:41.520 --> 00:01:43.550 line:0%
[Virtue Shines Through Abundance]

00:01:43.550 --> 00:01:46.630 line:0%
[Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:45.000 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:45.960 line:0%
looks like we won't be having

00:01:45.960 --> 00:01:47.200 line:0%
that welcome banquet today.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:47.960 line:0%
Mr. Pan

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:49.440 line:0%
has discovered an important figure

00:01:49.440 --> 00:01:50.760 line:0%
in the headless corpse case.

00:01:50.760 --> 00:01:51.559 line:0%
Who is it?

00:01:51.720 --> 00:01:53.080 line:0%
His name is Liu Zongyuan,

00:01:53.080 --> 00:01:54.080 line:0%
the neighbor and tenant

00:01:54.080 --> 00:01:55.400 line:0%
of the victim, Li Kaixiang.

00:01:55.400 --> 00:01:56.529 line:0%
After the incident,

00:01:56.720 --> 00:01:58.120 line:0%
I found that many of the victim's land

00:01:58.120 --> 00:01:59.559 line:0%
had fallen into his hands.

00:01:59.559 --> 00:02:01.360 line:0%
So I went to investigate his house.

00:02:01.360 --> 00:02:02.160 line:0%
I found that this person

00:02:02.160 --> 00:02:03.760 line:0%
had just moved out recently.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:04.680 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:02:05.440 --> 00:02:07.160 line:0%
could your office dispatch some men

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:08.650 line:0%
to investigate his whereabouts?

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.400 line:0%
It would be best to bring him back.

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:11.200 line:0%
No problem.

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:14.520 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:15.520 line:0%
I'm truly sorry.

00:02:15.680 --> 00:02:17.500 line:0%
Today was indeed an unexpected situation.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:19.000 line:0%
I hope you can understand.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:20.280 line:0%
Investigating the case is the priority.

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:22.680 line:0%
Governor Mo, there's no need to feel sorry.

00:02:23.120 --> 00:02:24.720 line:0%
Since he hasn't been gone long

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.480 line:0%
and it's still a distance to the city gates,

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:28.020 line:0%
why not issue a city lockdown order?

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:29.960 line:0%
The Imperial Guards will intensify the search.

00:02:29.960 --> 00:02:32.090 line:0%
We might just be able to keep him here.

00:02:32.780 --> 00:02:34.530 line:0%
You're absolutely right.

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:35.920 line:0%
I'll order Bi Qiu

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.720 line:0%
to draft and issue the lockdown order.

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.000 line:0%
I hope we can apprehend the real culprit

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:40.129 line:0%
as soon as possible.

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:42.720 line:0%
If we could also

00:02:42.800 --> 00:02:44.680 line:0%
dispel the rumors about the Half-faced Ghost

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:45.680 line:0%
eating people in their sleep,

00:02:45.680 --> 00:02:47.140 line:0%
that would be even better.

00:02:51.960 --> 00:02:53.760 line:0%
I'm afraid I'll be home late today.

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:54.760 line:0%
Don't wait for me.

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:05.120 line:0%
Let's go.

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:06.640 line:0%
I'm leaving.

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:11.230 line:0%
[Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:03:13.440 --> 00:03:14.450 line:0%
It's still early.

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:17.500 line:0%
Let's go to the prison and meet Li Kairui.

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:18.520 line:0%
What do you think?

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:22.400 line:0%
We've searched every street and alley

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:23.400 line:0%
in Yingzhou City,

00:03:23.840 --> 00:03:25.840 line:0%
but there's no sign of Liu Zongyuan.

00:03:26.040 --> 00:03:27.640 line:0%
He's either escaped the city

00:03:27.840 --> 00:03:29.400 line:0%
or he's still hiding in some house

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:30.440 line:0%
within the city.

00:03:32.280 --> 00:03:33.120 line:0%
We've already ordered

00:03:33.120 --> 00:03:33.920 line:0%
the city gates to be sealed,

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:35.680 line:0%
and we've set up checkpoints along the way.

00:03:35.680 --> 00:03:36.280 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan's

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:37.879 line:0%
chances of escaping the city

00:03:37.879 --> 00:03:38.680 line:0%
are very slim.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:39.920 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:03:40.240 --> 00:03:41.160 line:0%
I suggest

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:43.320 line:0%
we search again the courtyards

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:45.610 line:0%
where the suspect might be hiding.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:48.900 line:0%
Forget it.

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:50.400 line:0%
The citizens in the city

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:51.160 line:0%
are already

00:03:51.160 --> 00:03:52.280 line:0%
on edge due to

00:03:52.280 --> 00:03:53.560 line:0%
the recent murders.

00:03:53.879 --> 00:03:55.080 line:0%
If they see officials

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:56.640 line:0%
searching homes in the middle of the night,

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:58.840 line:0%
I'm afraid it will cause more unrest.

00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:01.440 line:0%
As you've seen,

00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:03.080 line:0%
checkpoints have been set up at the city gates.

00:04:03.080 --> 00:04:06.220 line:0%
My soldiers will strictly check everyone entering and leaving.

00:04:06.220 --> 00:04:07.680 line:0%
He won't be able to escape.

00:04:08.560 --> 00:04:09.200 line:0%
Go in.

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:11.520 line:0%
Next.

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:14.840 line:0%
Write here.

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:17.259 line:0%
What's in your bag?

00:04:17.710 --> 00:04:19.370 line:0%
The soldiers of Yingzhou City

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.310 line:0%
are indeed well-disciplined,

00:04:20.310 --> 00:04:21.569 line:0%
quite extraordinary.

00:04:21.970 --> 00:04:22.960 line:0%
I suppose the commanding officer

00:04:22.960 --> 00:04:25.120 line:0%
has put a lot of effort and resources into training them.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.360 line:0%
Their breastplates, back armor, and pauldrons

00:04:26.360 --> 00:04:28.020 line:0%
are all of excellent quality,

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.610 line:0%
unlike those of ordinary frontier soldiers.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:34.920 line:0%
You've come from the Imperial City,

00:04:34.920 --> 00:04:35.760 line:0%
so you must have seen plenty of

00:04:35.760 --> 00:04:36.959 line:0%
fine military equipment.

00:04:36.959 --> 00:04:38.080 line:0%
My armor is

00:04:38.100 --> 00:04:39.300 line:0%
nothing special.

00:04:40.220 --> 00:04:41.290 line:0%
Yingzhou City

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:43.160 line:0%
is located on the Western Region's frontier.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:45.240 line:0%
Defense is of utmost importance.

00:04:45.400 --> 00:04:47.280 line:0%
We save on every expense we can,

00:04:47.280 --> 00:04:48.520 line:0%
and all the money I can spare

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.140 line:0%
goes into military supplies.

00:04:50.140 --> 00:04:51.720 line:0%
We have no choice.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.170 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:04:59.410 --> 00:05:00.740 line:0%
We've found the person.

00:05:19.120 --> 00:05:19.920 line:0%
This is

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:21.520 line:0%
Secretary Yan from the Ministry of Justice.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:22.680 line:0%
She has some questions for you.

00:05:22.680 --> 00:05:23.560 line:0%
Madam,

00:05:22.770 --> 00:05:24.430 line:0%
[Li Kairui]

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.240 line:0%
I am innocent.

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:26.920 line:0%
No need to rush to plead your innocence to me.

00:05:26.920 --> 00:05:27.840 line:0%
Just answer

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:29.040 line:0%
my questions.

00:05:29.310 --> 00:05:31.040 line:0%
As long as you can clear my name,

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:31.800 line:0%
I'm willing to do

00:05:31.800 --> 00:05:32.600 line:0%
anything.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:33.360 line:0%
Do you know

00:05:33.360 --> 00:05:34.240 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan?

00:05:34.280 --> 00:05:34.760 line:0%
Yes, I do.

00:05:34.760 --> 00:05:36.680 line:0%
He's on good terms with my elder brother.

00:05:36.680 --> 00:05:37.800 line:0%
On the day of the incident,

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:38.880 line:0%
I had invited him and my brother

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:39.990 line:0%
to drink together,

00:05:40.160 --> 00:05:42.160 line:0%
but he left early because of something urgent.

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:42.959 line:0%
Therefore,

00:05:43.160 --> 00:05:44.000 line:0%
there's no one who can prove

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.080 line:0%
my innocence.

00:05:45.440 --> 00:05:46.640 line:0%
Do you know

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:47.570 line:0%
where he's from?

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:50.510 line:0%
I only know that he's a merchant.

00:05:51.520 --> 00:05:52.480 line:0%
In business matters,

00:05:52.480 --> 00:05:54.540 line:0%
he has even advised my elder brother.

00:05:55.570 --> 00:05:58.050 line:0%
Does Liu Zongyuan know martial arts?

00:05:58.200 --> 00:05:59.160 line:0%
No,

00:05:59.320 --> 00:06:00.680 line:0%
he's just a merchant.

00:06:00.720 --> 00:06:01.920 line:0%
How can you be so sure?

00:06:03.440 --> 00:06:04.640 line:0%
I remember once

00:06:04.840 --> 00:06:06.680 line:0%
a snake got into his house,

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.320 line:0%
and it was my elder brother who helped catch it.

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:17.220 line:0%
Secretary Yan.

00:06:17.720 --> 00:06:18.920 line:0%
What are you writing?

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:21.620 line:0%
Just recording the case details.

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:24.760 line:0%
There's also a sketch of the Half-faced Ghost.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:27.480 line:0%
I drew it myself

00:06:27.480 --> 00:06:29.040 line:0%
based on my imagination.

00:06:30.960 --> 00:06:31.920 line:0%
Secretary Yan,

00:06:31.920 --> 00:06:33.280 line:0%
you have such talent.

00:06:33.360 --> 00:06:34.760 line:0%
Why don't you show it to me?

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:36.440 line:0%
Let me see what does

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:38.360 line:0%
the Half-faced Ghost look like in your mind.

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.000 line:0%
I'll show it when we get back.

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:41.440 line:0%
Looking at it now

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:42.840 line:0%
would be too creepy.

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:45.440 line:0%
What if

00:06:45.440 --> 00:06:47.140 line:0%
we actually summon the Half-faced Ghost?

00:06:47.140 --> 00:06:48.720 line:0%
We'd all be done for.

00:06:49.480 --> 00:06:50.280 line:0%
You're right.

00:06:57.050 --> 00:06:58.700 line:0%
After your elder brother died,

00:06:58.700 --> 00:07:01.000 line:0%
there was nothing at the incision site initially.

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:02.020 line:0%
But suddenly one day,

00:07:02.020 --> 00:07:03.270 line:0%
his own sins

00:07:03.360 --> 00:07:04.200 line:0%
started to appear

00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:05.800 line:0%
at the incision site.

00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:07.520 line:0%
Do you know about this?

00:07:07.910 --> 00:07:08.870 line:0%
I don't know.

00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:10.260 line:0%
I don't know anything.

00:07:13.120 --> 00:07:14.320 line:0%
Since you don't know,

00:07:14.530 --> 00:07:16.140 line:0%
why don't you accompany us

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:17.880 line:0%
to take a look at the body?

00:07:18.040 --> 00:07:19.080 line:0%
We're not very clear

00:07:19.080 --> 00:07:20.440 line:0%
about these crimes.

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.880 line:0%
If you come with us,

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:23.760 line:0%
you might be able to explain them.

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:24.140 line:0%
Guards.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:24.800 line:0%
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:07:25.770 --> 00:07:27.170 line:0%
No, no.

00:07:27.190 --> 00:07:28.610 line:0%
I'm not going.

00:07:28.740 --> 00:07:30.790 line:0%
That scene is too horrifying.

00:07:30.980 --> 00:07:32.870 line:0%
I really can't bear to watch it!

00:07:37.040 --> 00:07:38.250 line:0%
Especially

00:07:38.959 --> 00:07:41.000 line:0%
it's my own brother.

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.760 line:0%
Since he's your own brother,

00:07:43.770 --> 00:07:46.250 line:0%
you should go see him in person.

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:48.120 line:0%
You've been claiming your innocence.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:49.640 line:0%
It's just a list of crimes.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:50.970 line:0%
No need to be so nervous.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:54.920 line:0%
Well,

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.120 line:0%
I beg you.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:57.800 line:0%
I'm begging you.

00:07:57.880 --> 00:07:59.000 line:0%
I... I'll say it.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:07:59.840 line:0%
I'll say it.

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.120 line:0%
My elder brother

00:08:02.560 --> 00:08:04.560 line:0%
did do some foolish things in the past,

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:06.640 line:0%
but he didn't deserve to be beheaded.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:13.400 line:0%
When he was young,

00:08:14.210 --> 00:08:15.740 line:0%
he was addicted to gambling

00:08:16.060 --> 00:08:17.920 line:0%
and lost all our family property.

00:08:17.960 --> 00:08:19.800 line:0%
Later, he quit gambling,

00:08:19.920 --> 00:08:21.380 line:0%
started a small business,

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:22.800 line:0%
and made some money.

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:25.920 line:0%
But recently, he started borrowing money again,

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:27.760 line:0%
even mortgaging our land.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:28.960 line:0%
We suspected

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:30.680 line:0%
he had started gambling again.

00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:31.480 line:0%
Who knew

00:08:31.600 --> 00:08:32.560 line:0%
he would believe in

00:08:32.560 --> 00:08:34.560 line:0%
a warlock introduced by our neighbor,

00:08:34.560 --> 00:08:37.520 line:0%
and spend all his money on so-called "elixirs"?

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:45.110 line:0%
[Dafu Tea House]

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:39.920 line:0%
We had

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.440 line:0%
a big argument over this.

00:08:41.640 --> 00:08:42.500 line:0%
Not long after,

00:08:42.640 --> 00:08:43.830 line:0%
that neighbor who introduced the warlock,

00:08:43.830 --> 00:08:44.680 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan,

00:08:44.920 --> 00:08:45.800 line:0%
actually came directly to

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:50.000 line:0%
[Clarify and Calm the Mind]

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:46.920 line:0%
Da Fu's teahouse.

00:08:53.250 --> 00:08:54.790 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan!

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:58.250 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:08:58.450 --> 00:08:59.990 line:0%
please calm down.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:01.160 line:0%
I didn't come here

00:09:01.200 --> 00:09:02.680 line:0%
to provoke you.

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:04.400 line:0%
I actually have something to discuss.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:06.000 line:0%
We have nothing to say to you!

00:09:06.280 --> 00:09:07.410 line:0%
If it weren't for you

00:09:07.480 --> 00:09:08.200 line:0%
introducing that warlock

00:09:08.200 --> 00:09:09.720 line:0%
to my elder brother,

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:10.720 line:0%
would he have ended up

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:11.720 line:0%
like this today?

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:13.320 line:0%
How dare you show your face here?

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:14.040 line:0%
What you've done

00:09:14.040 --> 00:09:14.920 line:0%
to his brother?

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:16.680 line:0%
He even sold all his family's farmland!

00:09:16.680 --> 00:09:17.800 line:0%
Do you have any conscience

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:19.000 line:0%
doing such a thing?

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:20.200 line:0%
I only mentioned

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:21.960 line:0%
that warlock in casual conversation,

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:23.800 line:0%
sharing it as an interesting anecdote.

00:09:23.800 --> 00:09:24.920 line:0%
I never expected

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.120 line:0%
that Li would become so obsessed

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.440 line:0%
that he sold his farmland.

00:09:27.440 --> 00:09:28.960 line:0%
I deeply regret it too.

00:09:29.240 --> 00:09:30.400 line:0%
What I can do now

00:09:30.480 --> 00:09:31.320 line:0%
is only

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:33.280 line:0%
to help minimize his losses.

00:09:33.280 --> 00:09:34.040 line:0%
These days,

00:09:34.040 --> 00:09:35.920 line:0%
I've been managing his business for him.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:36.640 line:0%
Moreover,

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:38.320 line:0%
I've already helped him

00:09:38.360 --> 00:09:39.080 line:0%
buy back all those

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:40.320 line:0%
farmlands he sold.

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.760 line:0%
It's all in Li's name.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:43.540 line:0%
If you don't believe me,

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:45.510 line:0%
I have the documents to prove it.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.400 line:0%
Dafu, this...

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:58.680 line:0%
[September 16th, Yuanhe 4th Year, Written by Liu Zongyuan on behalf]

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:59.120 line:0%
So Liu Zongyuan is actually a good person.

00:09:59.120 --> 00:10:01.120 line:0%
The three of us agreed to meet my brother

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:02.440 line:0%
for a drink in two days,

00:10:02.480 --> 00:10:04.200 line:0%
to try to persuade him.

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.800 line:0%
Well, Mr. Ji,

00:10:06.160 --> 00:10:07.440 line:0%
I just remembered

00:10:07.440 --> 00:10:08.840 line:0%
there are some business matters

00:10:08.840 --> 00:10:09.880 line:0%
that I don't understand.

00:10:09.880 --> 00:10:11.320 line:0%
I'd like to ask for your advice.

00:10:11.270 --> 00:10:12.500 line:0%
[Li Kaixiang]

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:13.200 line:0%
Can we talk privately for a moment?

00:10:13.200 --> 00:10:13.920 line:0%
Alright.

00:10:14.240 --> 00:10:16.630 line:0%
You two keep drinking,

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.040 line:0%
We'll come back

00:10:18.040 --> 00:10:19.480 line:0%
after we finish our chat.

00:10:19.480 --> 00:10:20.160 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.420 line:0%
please go on.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:22.600 line:0%
I understand.

00:10:22.680 --> 00:10:23.400 line:0%
They deliberately

00:10:23.400 --> 00:10:24.080 line:0%
created an opportunity

00:10:24.080 --> 00:10:25.520 line:0%
for us brothers to be alone,

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:27.180 line:0%
so I could try to persuade him.

00:10:28.520 --> 00:10:29.320 line:0%
Come here.

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:30.240 line:0%
Brother.

00:10:32.800 --> 00:10:33.600 line:0%
Brother.

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:34.960 line:0%
Look at

00:10:35.180 --> 00:10:37.480 line:0%
what you've become now.

00:10:37.660 --> 00:10:40.120 line:0%
You've lost so much weight in just a few days.

00:10:40.150 --> 00:10:41.090 line:0%
Don't

00:10:41.120 --> 00:10:42.470 line:0%
believe in that

00:10:42.490 --> 00:10:44.470 line:0%
warlock's slanderous words anymore.

00:10:44.470 --> 00:10:45.950 line:0%
Living a good life

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:47.240 line:0%
is better than anything else.

00:10:47.240 --> 00:10:47.840 line:0%
Brother,

00:10:47.840 --> 00:10:49.100 line:0%
you don't understand.

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:51.530 line:0%
That Immortal Yuan truly has supernatural powers.

00:10:51.530 --> 00:10:53.220 line:0%
He can summon deities to descend.

00:10:53.220 --> 00:10:55.610 line:0%
I have seen it with my own eyes.

00:10:56.200 --> 00:10:57.480 line:0%
In my opinion,

00:10:57.480 --> 00:10:58.280 line:0%
you shouldn't bother with

00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.080 line:0%
those trivial matters anymore.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.560 line:0%
Why don't you join me

00:11:02.600 --> 00:11:03.800 line:0%
in cultivating immortality?

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:04.560 line:0%
Forget about summoning deities

00:11:04.560 --> 00:11:05.560 line:0%
and immortality!

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.040 line:0%
Those are all just tricks to deceive people!

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:08.840 line:0%
Brother,

00:11:09.040 --> 00:11:10.300 line:0%
after all these years,

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:12.240 line:0%
we've sacrificed so much. How...

00:11:12.680 --> 00:11:13.920 line:0%
How can you easily believe

00:11:13.920 --> 00:11:14.960 line:0%
in these things?

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:16.560 line:0%
And even be obsessed with them!

00:11:16.560 --> 00:11:17.280 line:0%
Don't you feel sorry

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:18.880 line:0%
for our parents who are gone?

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:19.760 line:0%
Don't you feel sorry

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:20.400 line:0%
for all these years of our efforts?

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.120 line:0%
Enough!

00:11:21.120 --> 00:11:22.400 line:0%
You're the foolish one!

00:11:22.400 --> 00:11:24.400 line:0%
Not even believing in your own brother.

00:11:24.400 --> 00:11:25.840 line:0%
How could I deceive you?

00:11:31.200 --> 00:11:33.200 line:0%
Since we can't come to an agreement,

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:35.440 line:0%
what's the point of continuing?

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:50.400 line:0%
Brother,

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:51.320 line:0%
you...

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:01.240 line:0%
[Dafu Tea House]

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:13.780 line:0%
Later on,

00:12:14.670 --> 00:12:17.560 line:0%
I've been imprisoned ever since.

00:12:17.980 --> 00:12:20.030 line:0%
When I woke up and saw that scene,

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:21.920 line:0%
I really couldn't understand

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:24.160 line:0%
what exactly happened that day.

00:12:27.560 --> 00:12:28.420 line:0%
Secretary Yan,

00:12:28.840 --> 00:12:30.320 line:0%
I think it's about time.

00:12:30.320 --> 00:12:31.450 line:0%
We should get going.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:32.360 line:0%
Time?

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:33.760 line:0%
What time?

00:12:35.600 --> 00:12:36.400 line:0%
But

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.880 line:0%
you need to change your clothes.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:48.680 line:0%
Why did you bring me

00:12:48.680 --> 00:12:49.810 line:0%
to a place like this?

00:12:50.280 --> 00:12:51.720 line:0%
Because I found a clue.

00:12:51.920 --> 00:12:53.960 line:0%
It's not easy to book time with this top courtesan.

00:12:53.960 --> 00:12:55.090 line:0%
Let's hurry inside.

00:12:56.720 --> 00:12:57.480 line:0%
Mr. Pan,

00:12:57.480 --> 00:12:58.760 line:0%
you've finally come.

00:12:58.760 --> 00:13:00.880 line:0%
Please come to the private room on the third floor.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:01.960 line:0%
This way, please.

00:13:06.710 --> 00:13:07.630 line:0%
Here.

00:13:11.040 --> 00:13:13.320 line:0%
Alright, I'm in good spirits today.

00:13:13.320 --> 00:13:15.510 line:0%
Join me for a few more drinks.

00:13:17.240 --> 00:13:18.040 line:0%
Please.

00:13:20.040 --> 00:13:20.960 line:0%
Mr. Pan,

00:13:21.000 --> 00:13:22.840 line:0%
please make yourselves comfortable here.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.720 line:0%
Xiuxiu will be here shortly.

00:13:42.930 --> 00:13:46.140 line:0%
Like a dream, like an immortal, suddenly drifting away.

00:13:46.390 --> 00:13:49.920 line:0%
Where is the evening glow, leaving only the empty green screen?

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:55.540 line:0%
Mr. Pan, you're truly impressive.

00:13:55.840 --> 00:13:57.700 line:0%
You seem to have acquaintances everywhere.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:13:58.620 line:0%
It seems

00:13:58.650 --> 00:14:00.530 line:0%
you're a regular here as well.

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:04.610 line:0%
I'm only here to investigate the case,

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.530 line:0%
nothing more.

00:14:06.720 --> 00:14:09.040 line:0%
Since Xiuxiu is the top courtesan,

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:10.810 line:0%
she must be very beautiful.

00:14:10.830 --> 00:14:12.350 line:0%
I'd like to see for myself

00:14:12.510 --> 00:14:14.310 line:0%
how the beauty of Gannan Area

00:14:14.360 --> 00:14:15.970 line:0%
compares to that of Xiang'an.

00:14:15.970 --> 00:14:17.960 line:0%
Even the lotus can't compare to a beauty's makeup.

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.820 line:0%
In the water palace, the wind brings the fragrance of pearls and jade.

00:14:26.930 --> 00:14:28.590 line:0%
[Xiuxiu]

00:14:27.120 --> 00:14:28.480 line:0%
Your poem

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:29.800 line:0%
is filled with the gentle autumn breeze,

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:31.600 line:0%
the fragrance of lotus flowers.

00:14:31.680 --> 00:14:33.680 line:0%
Even the dew-laden lotus

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:36.020 line:0%
cannot compare to the beauty before you.

00:14:36.240 --> 00:14:37.720 line:0%
The scent of beauty carried by the wind

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:39.680 line:0%
is more ethereal than the lotus.

00:14:43.650 --> 00:14:44.900 line:0%
But

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:47.100 line:0%
to whom is your

00:14:47.550 --> 00:14:49.260 line:0%
admiration intended?

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:54.280 line:0%
The beauty dances like a spinning lotus;

00:14:54.640 --> 00:14:57.270 line:0%
The world has eyes but has not seen such.

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:02.870 line:0%
It doesn't matter to whom.

00:15:03.210 --> 00:15:04.360 line:0%
What matters is that

00:15:04.600 --> 00:15:06.000 line:0%
the beauty is right here,

00:15:06.290 --> 00:15:08.550 line:0%
yet she doesn't understand my feelings.

00:15:13.610 --> 00:15:14.750 line:0%
Miss Xiuxiu,

00:15:15.040 --> 00:15:16.320 line:0%
I asked you to help me

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:18.210 line:0%
investigate Liu Zongyuan.

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:22.970 line:0%
What about the poem I asked?

00:15:24.800 --> 00:15:27.160 line:0%
I haven't forgotten.

00:15:33.640 --> 00:15:35.140 line:0%
I've also kept

00:15:35.240 --> 00:15:36.880 line:0%
your instructions in mind.

00:15:37.800 --> 00:15:39.600 line:0%
When Liu Zongyuan first came,

00:15:39.840 --> 00:15:40.920 line:0%
he could barely afford

00:15:40.920 --> 00:15:42.320 line:0%
the tea fee for the main hall.

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:43.040 line:0%
However,

00:15:43.040 --> 00:15:44.470 line:0%
from some point on,

00:15:44.560 --> 00:15:46.420 line:0%
he became very generous,

00:15:46.720 --> 00:15:48.400 line:0%
often asking for my company.

00:15:50.280 --> 00:15:51.330 line:0%
Let me tell you,

00:15:51.480 --> 00:15:52.560 line:0%
that family

00:15:53.000 --> 00:15:54.580 line:0%
are all fools.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:56.990 line:0%
With just a few handwritten notes,

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.990 line:0%
I managed to deceive them.

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:02.580 line:0%
His brother and brother-in-law

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:03.840 line:0%
need medication even more.

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:06.940 line:0%
Why don't we sell them some "elixirs" too?

00:16:07.240 --> 00:16:09.970 line:0%
You're so wicked.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:11.410 line:0%
That Liu Zongyuan

00:16:11.520 --> 00:16:13.430 line:0%
must have teamed up with some swindlers

00:16:13.430 --> 00:16:15.470 line:0%
to seize other people's property.

00:16:31.640 --> 00:16:32.770 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:35.480 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan was the biggest beneficiary

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:36.920 line:0%
after Li Kaixiang's death.

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.080 line:0%
He gradually

00:16:38.080 --> 00:16:39.940 line:0%
took over the Li family's assets,

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:42.010 line:0%
until he drained them completely,

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:43.120 line:0%
and then fled.

00:16:43.720 --> 00:16:45.600 line:0%
He cut off the corpse's head

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:47.280 line:0%
perhaps in order to

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:49.640 line:0%
[A delicate fragrance that rises by the sleeve.
A lovely girl with her hair coiled in a bun
secretly trims
a touch of bright red on her fingertips.]

00:16:47.320 --> 00:16:48.640 line:0%
link all the clues

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:50.240 line:0%
to the Half-faced Ghost,

00:16:50.240 --> 00:16:51.960 line:0%
thereby creating panic

00:16:51.960 --> 00:16:53.620 line:0%
and misleading our judgment.

00:16:58.760 --> 00:16:59.920 line:0%
Xiuxiu and Pan Chi

00:16:59.920 --> 00:17:01.850 line:0%
haven't known each other for long.

00:17:02.040 --> 00:17:02.800 line:0%
Why would she

00:17:02.800 --> 00:17:04.330 line:0%
be so open-hearted with him

00:17:04.480 --> 00:17:05.760 line:0%
and tell him so much?

00:17:07.369 --> 00:17:09.080 line:0%
While you were watering the flowers just now,

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:10.440 line:0%
I wrote a new poem.

00:17:11.040 --> 00:17:13.060 line:0%
After the rain, a few light flowers bloom.

00:17:13.060 --> 00:17:15.780 line:0%
Trying to be graceful on a cool summer day.

00:17:16.200 --> 00:17:17.840 line:0%
Lotus on the pond, untouched by dust,

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:18.909 line:0%
grows tiresome to the eye.

00:17:18.909 --> 00:17:21.580 line:0%
While a small butterfly flutters over the wall, lifting spirits.

00:17:21.580 --> 00:17:23.790 line:0%
Emerald leaves ripple in the gentle breeze.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:24.790 line:0%
Softly cradling.

00:17:25.369 --> 00:17:27.970 line:0%
A delicate fragrance that rises by the sleeve.

00:17:28.110 --> 00:17:30.440 line:0%
A lovely girl with her hair coiled in a bun.

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:31.580 line:0%
Secretly trims.

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.570 line:0%
A touch of bright red on her fingertips.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:35.880 line:0%
You two,

00:17:35.960 --> 00:17:39.280 line:0%
keep this gentleman company.

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:42.370 line:0%
Nice to meet you, sir.

00:17:42.680 --> 00:17:43.480 line:0%
This is...

00:17:47.420 --> 00:17:48.280 line:0%
It seems this madam

00:17:48.280 --> 00:17:49.540 line:0%
is quite experienced.

00:17:49.560 --> 00:17:50.990 line:0%
She won't be fooled by

00:17:51.080 --> 00:17:52.540 line:0%
a woman disguised as a man.

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:53.880 line:0%
Come on, sir,

00:17:53.900 --> 00:17:55.100 line:0%
let me offer you a cup.

00:17:55.520 --> 00:17:57.400 line:0%
You've been working so hard on cases usually.

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:58.760 line:0%
It's not easy to relax like this.

00:17:58.760 --> 00:17:59.560 line:0%
Drink up.

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:01.880 line:0%
I...

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:04.860 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.280 line:0%
what brings you here?

00:18:22.920 --> 00:18:24.320 line:0%
Let me explain.

00:18:24.320 --> 00:18:25.320 line:0%
We went to Xiuxiang House

00:18:25.320 --> 00:18:26.760 line:0%
just to investigate the case, really.

00:18:26.760 --> 00:18:27.400 line:0%
I didn't call for

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:28.320 line:0%
those male entertainers.

00:18:28.320 --> 00:18:29.850 line:0%
I didn't even touch them.

00:18:29.970 --> 00:18:30.840 line:0%
I believe you.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.560 line:0%
I'm not angry about that.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:35.200 line:0%
It's just that

00:18:35.200 --> 00:18:37.000 line:0%
if you go out to investigate at night next time,

00:18:37.000 --> 00:18:38.400 line:0%
you could let me know.

00:18:38.880 --> 00:18:39.680 line:0%
I couldn't find you back at the mansion.

00:18:39.680 --> 00:18:41.940 line:0%
I thought something had happened to you.

00:18:42.600 --> 00:18:44.480 line:0%
It was a sudden situation.

00:18:44.880 --> 00:18:45.720 line:0%
Next time,

00:18:45.720 --> 00:18:46.480 line:0%
I will definitely

00:18:46.480 --> 00:18:47.760 line:0%
inform you in advance.

00:18:47.780 --> 00:18:48.520 line:0%
By the way,

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:50.320 line:0%
have you found Liu Zongyuan?

00:18:50.320 --> 00:18:52.240 line:0%
He fraudulently seized the Li family's land.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.080 line:0%
He's very likely

00:18:53.080 --> 00:18:54.810 line:0%
the one who killed Li Kaixiang.

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:56.320 line:0%
We did find him.

00:18:56.920 --> 00:18:58.360 line:0%
Then let's go back and interrogate him.

00:18:58.360 --> 00:18:59.880 line:0%
He's already a corpse.

00:19:00.520 --> 00:19:02.980 line:0%
I'm afraid he won't be able to speak anymore.

00:19:13.920 --> 00:19:15.800 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan lost his liver,

00:19:16.200 --> 00:19:17.000 line:0%
and it was

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:19.080 line:0%
taken out right here.

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:44.480 line:0%
People laugh at moths flying into the fire,

00:19:44.480 --> 00:19:46.870 line:0%
not realizing they are like mayflies,

00:19:46.980 --> 00:19:49.680 line:0%
living from morning to night without entering the cycle of reincarnation.

00:19:49.680 --> 00:19:51.640 line:0%
Moths go through fire and don't die;

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:53.240 line:0%
they are reborn in the cycle.

00:19:53.290 --> 00:19:54.800 line:0%
With a human face but a beast's heart,

00:19:54.800 --> 00:19:56.200 line:0%
one cannot escape blame.

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:58.340 line:0%
Disrespect the fire moth,

00:19:58.960 --> 00:20:00.960 line:0%
and calamity shall descend from the heavens.

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:03.820 line:0%
It's the Half-faced Ghost and Fire Moth Sect again.

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:06.490 line:0%
This Liu Zongyuan

00:20:06.840 --> 00:20:08.040 line:0%
was a martial artist.

00:20:11.200 --> 00:20:13.060 line:0%
Look at the calluses on his hands.

00:20:26.580 --> 00:20:27.570 line:0%
So it seems

00:20:27.760 --> 00:20:29.000 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:30.040 line:0%
deliberately disguised himself

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.220 line:0%
as a non-martial person,

00:20:31.220 --> 00:20:32.330 line:0%
posing as a merchant

00:20:32.330 --> 00:20:33.660 line:0%
to secretly kill people,

00:20:33.660 --> 00:20:35.820 line:0%
but was later silenced.

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:38.920 line:0%
Perhaps...

00:20:40.040 --> 00:20:41.880 line:0%
we're overthinking this.

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:44.210 line:0%
There's a simpler way

00:20:44.400 --> 00:20:45.930 line:0%
to deduce the real culprit.

00:20:46.280 --> 00:20:47.560 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan fraudulently took

00:20:47.560 --> 00:20:48.600 line:0%
all of the Li family's property,

00:20:48.600 --> 00:20:50.640 line:0%
forcing Li Kaixiang to borrow money everywhere.

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:51.960 line:0%
Who was hurt the most?

00:20:52.800 --> 00:20:54.040 line:0%
Li Kaixiang is dead,

00:20:54.040 --> 00:20:55.500 line:0%
and Li Kairui is in prison,

00:20:56.120 --> 00:20:57.540 line:0%
so that leaves only...

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.120 line:0%
Ji Dafu.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:00.040 line:0%
Correct.

00:21:00.530 --> 00:21:02.920 line:0%
Actually, I've been puzzled about something.

00:21:02.920 --> 00:21:05.200 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan, with forged documents,

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:06.680 line:0%
fabricated a story that

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:08.320 line:0%
he had already, in Li Kaixiang's name,

00:21:08.320 --> 00:21:10.520 line:0%
helped him reclaim the sold farmlands.

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:12.400 line:0%
How could he deceive Ji Dafu so easily,

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:13.160 line:0%
making him believe

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.560 line:0%
that he was a good person?

00:21:15.330 --> 00:21:16.480 line:0%
Ji Dafu, after all,

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:18.210 line:0%
also runs a teahouse business.

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:20.480 line:0%
Wouldn't this act of selfless dedication

00:21:20.480 --> 00:21:22.140 line:0%
raise suspicions in his mind?

00:21:23.600 --> 00:21:25.160 line:0%
Either Ji Dafu is naive enough

00:21:25.160 --> 00:21:26.490 line:0%
to easily trust others,

00:21:26.740 --> 00:21:27.540 line:0%
or...

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:28.520 line:0%
Or...

00:21:29.520 --> 00:21:30.860 line:0%
from the very beginning,

00:21:30.860 --> 00:21:31.960 line:0%
he never intended to believe

00:21:31.960 --> 00:21:33.320 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan's story.

00:21:34.320 --> 00:21:35.670 line:0%
All along,

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:36.800 line:0%
he wanted to take revenge on

00:21:36.800 --> 00:21:40.200 line:0%
Liu Zongyuan for defrauding the Li family of their property.

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:48.830 line:0%
Since Ji Dafu is a suspect,

00:21:49.600 --> 00:21:50.280 line:0%
why don't we

00:21:50.280 --> 00:21:51.880 line:0%
follow him and investigate?

00:21:53.060 --> 00:22:00.650 line:0%
[Jiqing Restaurant]

00:22:02.520 --> 00:22:03.440 line:0%
Watch your tone!

00:22:03.440 --> 00:22:03.920 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:05.140 line:0%
Don't push me!

00:22:05.600 --> 00:22:06.560 line:0%
Get out of the way!

00:22:06.560 --> 00:22:07.280 line:0%
My Lord,

00:22:07.280 --> 00:22:08.600 line:0%
you must stand up for me.

00:22:08.600 --> 00:22:09.840 line:0%
They're being unreasonable

00:22:09.840 --> 00:22:11.000 line:0%
and bullying me!

00:22:11.090 --> 00:22:12.200 line:0%
We have important matters to attend to.

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:13.200 line:0%
Let go of me.

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:14.900 line:0%
You have to hear me out, no matter what.

00:22:14.900 --> 00:22:16.320 line:0%
When faced with this situation,

00:22:16.320 --> 00:22:17.720 line:0%
you should report it to the authorities.

00:22:17.720 --> 00:22:18.360 line:0%
The prefectural governor

00:22:18.360 --> 00:22:19.840 line:0%
will do justice for you.

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:21.240 line:0%
That's right.

00:22:22.080 --> 00:22:24.080 line:0%
I should report to the authorities.

00:22:25.260 --> 00:22:27.250 line:0%
Why am I even bothering you?

00:22:37.600 --> 00:22:39.200 line:0%
Who are you people, exactly?

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.690 line:0%
We are a group returning home to visit relatives.

00:22:42.690 --> 00:22:44.070 line:0%
We have urgent matters to attend to,

00:22:44.070 --> 00:22:45.870 line:0%
so we won't disturb you further.

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:46.760 line:0%
Goodbye.

00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:49.680 line:0%
Let's go.

00:23:24.110 --> 00:23:25.480 line:0%
Greetings,

00:23:25.810 --> 00:23:27.010 line:0%
Secretary Yan,

00:23:27.890 --> 00:23:29.150 line:0%
Grand Commander Shen.

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:31.960 line:0%
What exactly

00:23:32.440 --> 00:23:33.560 line:0%
happened just now?

00:23:38.080 --> 00:23:39.840 line:0%
I am Sun Tan, the leader

00:23:38.280 --> 00:23:40.480 line:0%
[Sun Tan, Constable of Yingzhou]

00:23:39.840 --> 00:23:41.720 line:0%
of the constables in the Gannan Area.

00:23:41.720 --> 00:23:42.640 line:0%
What just happened

00:23:42.640 --> 00:23:43.680 line:0%
was just to make the three of you

00:23:43.680 --> 00:23:44.640 line:0%
stay a bit longer

00:23:45.240 --> 00:23:46.900 line:0%
to avoid running into Ji Dafu.

00:23:46.960 --> 00:23:48.080 line:0%
We've been investigating

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:49.240 line:0%
an usury case recently,

00:23:49.240 --> 00:23:50.760 line:0%
and it led us to Ji Dafu.

00:23:51.040 --> 00:23:52.320 line:0%
He's very elusive,

00:23:52.320 --> 00:23:54.050 line:0%
so we had to resort to this method

00:23:54.050 --> 00:23:55.610 line:0%
to avoid alerting him.

00:23:56.320 --> 00:23:58.280 line:0%
Please don't blame us for this.

00:23:58.880 --> 00:23:59.840 line:0%
It's alright.

00:24:00.040 --> 00:24:00.720 line:0%
However,

00:24:00.720 --> 00:24:02.520 line:0%
this method is too conspicuous.

00:24:02.520 --> 00:24:03.920 line:0%
If someone here

00:24:03.920 --> 00:24:04.680 line:0%
noticed you,

00:24:04.680 --> 00:24:05.880 line:0%
wouldn't that expose you?

00:24:05.880 --> 00:24:07.340 line:0%
You're absolutely right.

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:09.010 line:0%
We were careless this time.

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:11.400 line:0%
We'll be more careful next time.

00:24:12.080 --> 00:24:13.600 line:0%
If I hadn't caught a glimpse of the token,

00:24:13.600 --> 00:24:14.880 line:0%
I wouldn't have realized

00:24:14.620 --> 00:24:16.140 line:0%
[Constable Marshal]

00:24:15.240 --> 00:24:16.840 line:0%
that you are the constables.

00:24:17.440 --> 00:24:19.040 line:0%
Constable Marshal's token.

00:24:19.240 --> 00:24:20.040 line:0%
No need.

00:24:20.040 --> 00:24:21.040 line:0%
Please get up.

00:24:21.240 --> 00:24:22.440 line:0%
Seeing the token is like seeing the person.

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:23.280 line:0%
We constables

00:24:23.280 --> 00:24:24.720 line:0%
understand this rule.

00:24:25.960 --> 00:24:27.120 line:0%
Rest assured, Mrs. Shen.

00:24:27.120 --> 00:24:27.840 line:0%
In the future,

00:24:27.840 --> 00:24:28.360 line:0%
if there's any need

00:24:28.360 --> 00:24:29.640 line:0%
for us constables,

00:24:29.680 --> 00:24:31.400 line:0%
we will certainly do our utmost

00:24:31.400 --> 00:24:32.530 line:0%
and spare no effort.

00:24:38.920 --> 00:24:40.030 line:0%
You just said

00:24:40.320 --> 00:24:41.800 line:0%
Ji Dafu is elusive.

00:24:42.080 --> 00:24:43.360 line:0%
Did you find anything?

00:24:43.760 --> 00:24:44.680 line:0%
Ji Dafu appears to be

00:24:44.680 --> 00:24:45.680 line:0%
a teahouse owner,

00:24:45.880 --> 00:24:46.760 line:0%
but in fact, he runs

00:24:46.760 --> 00:24:48.000 line:0%
an underground gambling den

00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:49.440 line:0%
and also deals in usury.

00:24:49.600 --> 00:24:50.400 line:0%
A lot of money

00:24:50.400 --> 00:24:51.560 line:0%
is accounted for through

00:24:51.560 --> 00:24:52.490 line:0%
his gambling den

00:24:52.960 --> 00:24:54.560 line:0%
and then flows to various places.

00:24:54.560 --> 00:24:56.240 line:0%
The activities are highly suspicious.

00:24:56.240 --> 00:24:57.380 line:0%
Are you saying

00:24:57.520 --> 00:24:58.760 line:0%
that Ji Dafu

00:24:58.840 --> 00:24:59.800 line:0%
is likely helping

00:24:59.800 --> 00:25:01.240 line:0%
a powerful figure behind the scenes

00:25:01.240 --> 00:25:02.560 line:0%
to launder money by

00:25:02.560 --> 00:25:04.240 line:0%
using his gambling den as a conduit?

00:25:04.240 --> 00:25:05.600 line:0%
This case involves a wide range of people.

00:25:05.600 --> 00:25:06.840 line:0%
By following the leads,

00:25:06.840 --> 00:25:07.520 line:0%
we've discovered that

00:25:07.520 --> 00:25:08.520 line:0%
many officials in the Gannan Area

00:25:08.520 --> 00:25:09.600 line:0%
are also involved.

00:25:09.720 --> 00:25:11.580 line:0%
That's why we've had to act alone.

00:25:11.720 --> 00:25:12.580 line:0%
The three of you

00:25:13.360 --> 00:25:16.220 line:0%
want to check out the underground gambling den too?

00:25:18.360 --> 00:25:20.420 line:0%
You'll need to disguise yourselves.

00:25:35.910 --> 00:25:37.100 line:0%
Do you all remember?

00:25:37.570 --> 00:25:39.270 line:0%
You're Sun Daniu.

00:25:39.480 --> 00:25:40.280 line:0%
You're...

00:25:40.280 --> 00:25:41.400 line:0%
Liu Qingming.

00:25:42.000 --> 00:25:43.520 line:0%
I'm Wan Erge.

00:25:43.560 --> 00:25:44.520 line:0%
The three of us

00:25:44.520 --> 00:25:45.560 line:0%
are all merchants

00:25:45.560 --> 00:25:47.320 line:0%
coming to Gannan Area to do business.

00:25:47.320 --> 00:25:48.440 line:0%
You seem to have overlooked

00:25:48.440 --> 00:25:49.480 line:0%
a crucial issue.

00:25:50.400 --> 00:25:51.720 line:0%
-What is it?
-What issue?

00:25:51.720 --> 00:25:53.350 line:0%
We're heading to a gambling den.

00:25:53.350 --> 00:25:54.210 line:0%
Which one of you

00:25:55.250 --> 00:25:56.530 line:0%
is good at gambling?

00:25:58.760 --> 00:26:00.140 line:0%
Me of course.

00:26:00.240 --> 00:26:01.220 line:0%
I guarantee

00:26:01.360 --> 00:26:02.040 line:0%
I'll win so much

00:26:02.040 --> 00:26:04.100 line:0%
they'll even offer their land deeds.

00:26:06.850 --> 00:26:09.000 line:0%
[Dafu Tea House]

00:26:18.820 --> 00:26:21.500 line:0%
[Dafu Tea House]

00:26:22.720 --> 00:26:23.440 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:26:23.440 --> 00:26:24.570 line:0%
please come inside.

00:26:24.880 --> 00:26:25.680 line:0%
This way.

00:26:31.360 --> 00:26:32.460 line:0%
Wan Erge.

00:26:42.690 --> 00:26:44.000 line:0%
Once you're seated,

00:26:44.020 --> 00:26:45.710 line:0%
make a secret signal

00:26:45.740 --> 00:26:47.330 line:0%
when the waiter brings tea.

00:27:00.100 --> 00:27:01.280 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:27:01.820 --> 00:27:03.250 line:0%
please follow me.

00:27:07.070 --> 00:27:08.790 line:0%
Someone will take you to the gambling den.

00:27:08.790 --> 00:27:10.220 line:0%
I'll be on guard duty downstairs

00:27:10.220 --> 00:27:12.070 line:0%
and provide backup if needed.

00:27:13.400 --> 00:27:14.940 line:0%
Place your bets!

00:27:15.040 --> 00:27:16.120 line:0%
Place your bets!

00:27:16.200 --> 00:27:17.200 line:0%
Stop right there.

00:27:18.000 --> 00:27:18.800 line:0%
You three

00:27:19.760 --> 00:27:21.040 line:0%
look very unfamiliar.

00:27:23.760 --> 00:27:25.030 line:0%
Big!

00:27:26.220 --> 00:27:27.520 line:0%
Hurry up. Don't dawdle.

00:27:27.520 --> 00:27:29.200 line:0%
These gentlemen are bored

00:27:29.200 --> 00:27:30.160 line:0%
and want to play for high stakes.

00:27:30.160 --> 00:27:31.880 line:0%
Just take them inside.

00:27:32.280 --> 00:27:33.290 line:0%
Alright.

00:27:33.440 --> 00:27:34.240 line:0%
Got it.

00:27:34.640 --> 00:27:35.480 line:0%
Follow me.

00:27:40.520 --> 00:27:42.200 line:0%
-One more.
-One more time.

00:27:44.090 --> 00:27:45.120 line:0%
Come on.

00:27:45.140 --> 00:27:46.560 line:0%
Keep going, hurry!

00:27:46.980 --> 00:27:48.630 line:0%
Bet on big or small!

00:27:48.920 --> 00:27:49.590 line:0%
Big!

00:27:49.610 --> 00:27:50.440 line:0%
Excuse me.

00:27:51.280 --> 00:27:52.470 line:0%
Big, big!

00:27:52.600 --> 00:27:53.720 line:0%
No changing bets once placed!

00:27:53.720 --> 00:27:55.270 line:0%
Place your bets!

00:27:55.320 --> 00:27:56.080 line:0%
I won!

00:27:56.080 --> 00:27:58.010 line:0%
It's all mine!

00:27:58.040 --> 00:27:58.840 line:0%
I won!

00:28:03.000 --> 00:28:04.240 line:0%
Bet on big.

00:28:04.240 --> 00:28:10.240 line:0%
-Big!
-Small!

00:28:10.240 --> 00:28:11.320 line:0%
Help me out here.

00:28:15.320 --> 00:28:17.610 line:0%
Congratulations everyone!

00:28:18.080 --> 00:28:19.160 line:0%
One more time!

00:28:19.360 --> 00:28:20.890 line:0%
I'm betting big this round!

00:28:25.030 --> 00:28:26.560 line:0%
I'm betting big this round!

00:28:26.560 --> 00:28:27.240 line:0%
Place your bets!

00:28:27.240 --> 00:28:29.020 line:0%
How high are the stakes today?

00:28:29.050 --> 00:28:30.710 line:0%
Let's follow Wan Erge's lead.

00:28:32.920 --> 00:28:35.170 line:0%
Just play a few rounds today.

00:28:35.220 --> 00:28:36.250 line:0%
If you win, it's yours.

00:28:36.250 --> 00:28:37.510 line:0%
If you lose, it's on me.

00:28:37.560 --> 00:28:38.360 line:0%
Alright.

00:28:38.510 --> 00:28:39.880 line:0%
Then for this first round,

00:28:39.880 --> 00:28:40.720 line:0%
50 taels.

00:28:40.880 --> 00:28:41.480 line:0%
Okay.

00:28:42.160 --> 00:28:42.960 line:0%
Bet on big.

00:28:43.080 --> 00:28:44.960 line:0%
Everyone, place your bets!

00:28:48.270 --> 00:28:50.410 line:0%
Bet on big or small. Place your bets.

00:28:51.680 --> 00:28:52.680 line:0%
Watch carefully.

00:28:52.720 --> 00:28:53.520 line:0%
50 taels.

00:28:53.520 --> 00:28:54.440 line:0%
Watch closely.

00:28:54.600 --> 00:28:55.610 line:0%
Bet on big!

00:28:55.960 --> 00:28:56.640 line:0%
Everyone,

00:28:56.640 --> 00:28:58.640 line:0%
no changing bets. Place your bets!

00:28:58.640 --> 00:28:59.440 line:0%
I'm betting big!

00:28:59.440 --> 00:29:00.540 line:0%
I'm betting small!

00:29:07.890 --> 00:29:09.520 line:0%
There's definitely something fishy.

00:29:09.520 --> 00:29:12.300 line:0%
One, two, two, five points. Small.

00:29:13.900 --> 00:29:17.340 line:0%
Congratulations, everyone.

00:29:20.720 --> 00:29:21.920 line:0%
You're not lucky today.

00:29:21.920 --> 00:29:23.320 line:0%
Sun Daniu, you take over.

00:29:27.200 --> 00:29:28.120 line:0%
I, Liu Qingming,

00:29:28.120 --> 00:29:29.440 line:0%
really don't have good luck today.

00:29:29.440 --> 00:29:30.160 line:0%
Daniu,

00:29:30.350 --> 00:29:31.370 line:0%
your turn.

00:29:37.800 --> 00:29:38.720 line:0%
My stomach

00:29:38.720 --> 00:29:39.560 line:0%
suddenly started hurting.

00:29:39.560 --> 00:29:40.820 line:0%
What's wrong with him?

00:29:42.470 --> 00:29:43.270 line:0%
No, no.

00:29:44.000 --> 00:29:45.460 line:0%
I need to use the restroom.

00:29:52.160 --> 00:29:53.190 line:0%
But...

00:29:53.600 --> 00:29:55.160 line:0%
I'll wait until you finish this round

00:29:55.160 --> 00:29:56.250 line:0%
before I go.

00:29:57.650 --> 00:29:58.990 line:0%
Wan Erge

00:29:59.280 --> 00:30:01.210 line:0%
doesn't want to play small stakes.

00:30:01.280 --> 00:30:02.560 line:0%
He wants to play big.

00:30:02.580 --> 00:30:03.480 line:0%
Right.

00:30:05.040 --> 00:30:06.240 line:0%
I wonder how much you

00:30:06.240 --> 00:30:07.840 line:0%
gentlemen would like to bet?

00:30:08.520 --> 00:30:09.560 line:0%
1,000 taels.

00:30:09.560 --> 00:30:11.110 line:0%
One game to decide the winner!

00:30:11.110 --> 00:30:12.190 line:0%
1,000?

00:30:14.300 --> 00:30:15.920 line:0%
What? 1,000 taels?

00:30:17.720 --> 00:30:18.590 line:0%
Alright.

00:30:22.570 --> 00:30:23.810 line:0%
Such a big bet.

00:30:24.600 --> 00:30:26.200 line:0%
How about we change the odds?

00:30:26.290 --> 00:30:27.650 line:0%
Two to one?

00:30:33.040 --> 00:30:34.590 line:0%
Of course.

00:30:48.050 --> 00:30:49.910 line:0%
No regrets once the bet is placed.

00:30:56.080 --> 00:30:57.120 line:0%
1,000 taels.

00:30:57.150 --> 00:30:58.220 line:0%
I bet on big.

00:31:02.920 --> 00:31:06.280 line:0%
Open it.

00:31:06.380 --> 00:31:07.780 line:0%
What are you waiting for?

00:31:09.110 --> 00:31:10.460 line:0%
Hurry up and open it!

00:31:10.600 --> 00:31:12.130 line:0%
Yeah!

00:31:12.160 --> 00:31:14.260 line:0%
Come on, open it!

00:31:14.840 --> 00:31:15.610 line:0%
Yeah!

00:31:15.630 --> 00:31:17.030 line:0%
What are you waiting for?

00:31:20.520 --> 00:31:21.760 line:0%
When I was losing money earlier,

00:31:21.760 --> 00:31:23.200 line:0%
you opened it in no time.

00:31:23.240 --> 00:31:24.080 line:0%
Now what?

00:31:24.210 --> 00:31:25.270 line:0%
With such a big bet,

00:31:25.320 --> 00:31:27.160 line:0%
shouldn't you be opening quickly?

00:31:27.160 --> 00:31:28.080 line:0%
Exactly!

00:31:28.100 --> 00:31:30.580 line:0%
Open it! Open it! Open it!

00:31:30.610 --> 00:31:32.310 line:0%
Open! Open! Open!

00:31:32.590 --> 00:31:33.880 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:31:34.720 --> 00:31:35.400 line:0%
Open it.

00:31:35.400 --> 00:31:36.200 line:0%
Yeah!

00:31:36.200 --> 00:31:37.100 line:0%
Open it! Open it!

00:31:37.100 --> 00:31:38.480 line:0%
Open it! Open it!

00:31:38.480 --> 00:31:39.910 line:0%
Open it! Open it!

00:31:39.930 --> 00:31:41.480 line:0%
Open it!

00:31:41.580 --> 00:31:42.800 line:0%
What's going on?

00:31:43.910 --> 00:31:45.640 line:0%
We've been waiting for so long.

00:31:50.640 --> 00:31:51.610 line:0%
We won! We won!

00:31:51.640 --> 00:31:52.800 line:0%
-We won!
-Awesome!

00:31:52.800 --> 00:31:53.560 line:0%
We won!

00:31:54.190 --> 00:31:55.850 line:0%
[Always Wins]

00:31:54.520 --> 00:31:56.200 line:0%
We won! We won!

00:31:56.680 --> 00:31:57.690 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:31:57.760 --> 00:31:59.440 line:0%
your luck is really good today.

00:31:59.440 --> 00:32:00.200 line:0%
Why don't we

00:32:00.240 --> 00:32:01.240 line:0%
take advantage of this luck

00:32:01.240 --> 00:32:02.560 line:0%
and play one more round?

00:32:02.560 --> 00:32:03.890 line:0%
Our boss would like to

00:32:03.940 --> 00:32:05.490 line:0%
meet you all personally.

00:32:05.520 --> 00:32:06.640 line:0%
No more gambling.

00:32:06.640 --> 00:32:07.920 line:0%
Go tell your boss

00:32:07.920 --> 00:32:09.120 line:0%
that the money we've won today

00:32:09.120 --> 00:32:09.960 line:0%
is enough.

00:32:15.770 --> 00:32:16.900 line:0%
Well then,

00:32:17.520 --> 00:32:19.640 line:0%
I heard there are some distinguished guests here today.

00:32:19.640 --> 00:32:21.080 line:0%
I am Ji Dafu,

00:32:21.080 --> 00:32:22.830 line:0%
the owner of this gambling den.

00:32:23.480 --> 00:32:25.380 line:0%
I think gambling or not is not important.

00:32:25.380 --> 00:32:27.440 line:0%
What's important is making friends.

00:32:27.870 --> 00:32:30.300 line:0%
I've prepared fine tea in the parlor.

00:32:31.300 --> 00:32:34.700 line:0%
[Always Wins]

00:32:31.800 --> 00:32:33.400 line:0%
Please, come upstairs.

00:32:33.520 --> 00:32:35.080 line:0%
We can drink and chat.

00:32:43.520 --> 00:32:44.200 line:0%
Alright.

00:32:44.200 --> 00:32:45.400 line:0%
Let's get going then.

00:32:53.760 --> 00:32:54.410 line:0%
Xing.

00:33:02.850 --> 00:33:04.120 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:33:04.220 --> 00:33:06.170 line:0%
It's a pleasure to meet you all.

00:33:06.270 --> 00:33:07.260 line:0%
Come, come.

00:33:07.710 --> 00:33:08.640 line:0%
Please, come in.

00:33:09.880 --> 00:33:10.920 line:0%
Please, come in.

00:33:12.290 --> 00:33:13.490 line:0%
What are you doing?

00:33:13.830 --> 00:33:15.190 line:0%
You're so clumsy.

00:33:15.210 --> 00:33:17.030 line:0%
Don't scare my guests.

00:33:17.480 --> 00:33:18.280 line:0%
Boss,

00:33:18.310 --> 00:33:19.570 line:0%
this person is useless now.

00:33:19.570 --> 00:33:20.760 line:0%
How should we dispose of him?

00:33:20.760 --> 00:33:22.320 line:0%
What's the use of keeping someone useless?

00:33:22.320 --> 00:33:23.080 line:0%
Throw him out!

00:33:23.080 --> 00:33:23.720 line:0%
Yes.

00:33:24.440 --> 00:33:25.320 line:0%
Winning so much money

00:33:25.320 --> 00:33:26.800 line:0%
in my gambling den.

00:33:27.000 --> 00:33:27.880 line:0%
Don't you even consider

00:33:27.880 --> 00:33:29.440 line:0%
how long your life might be?

00:33:32.480 --> 00:33:33.800 line:0%
It seems the legend of

00:33:34.200 --> 00:33:34.960 line:0%
the Half-faced Ghost

00:33:34.960 --> 00:33:36.970 line:0%
eating people's limbs while they sleep

00:33:36.970 --> 00:33:38.630 line:0%
mostly comes from the victims

00:33:38.880 --> 00:33:41.200 line:0%
in the gambling den who had their limbs cut off

00:33:41.200 --> 00:33:42.640 line:0%
and dared not speak the truth,

00:33:42.640 --> 00:33:44.240 line:0%
claiming amnesia instead.

00:33:45.420 --> 00:33:47.740 line:0%
I apologize

00:33:47.800 --> 00:33:49.760 line:0%
for the clumsiness of my men.

00:33:49.760 --> 00:33:51.280 line:0%
They really lack good judgment.

00:33:51.280 --> 00:33:52.400 line:0%
Did they scare you?

00:33:59.350 --> 00:34:00.680 line:0%
You just scared me!

00:34:00.680 --> 00:34:01.520 line:0%
What happened to that man's arm?

00:34:01.520 --> 00:34:02.560 line:0%
Why is it broken?

00:34:12.640 --> 00:34:13.600 line:0%
It's nothing.

00:34:13.880 --> 00:34:15.920 line:0%
It's all because that man's arm was too fragile.

00:34:15.920 --> 00:34:16.720 line:0%
Just a slight touch,

00:34:16.720 --> 00:34:17.760 line:0%
and it broke.

00:34:21.990 --> 00:34:23.080 line:0%
I can see that.

00:34:23.920 --> 00:34:24.979 line:0%
Gentlemen,

00:34:25.840 --> 00:34:26.760 line:0%
you've won quite

00:34:26.760 --> 00:34:28.560 line:0%
a lot of money in my gambling den.

00:34:28.840 --> 00:34:30.570 line:0%
That's not quite proper, is it?

00:34:31.200 --> 00:34:32.360 line:0%
This money is our winnings!

00:34:32.360 --> 00:34:33.240 line:0%
We didn't steal it!

00:34:33.240 --> 00:34:34.600 line:0%
How is that improper?

00:34:40.080 --> 00:34:41.320 line:0%
If that's the case,

00:34:41.680 --> 00:34:42.470 line:0%
I won't waste

00:34:42.470 --> 00:34:43.990 line:0%
any more words with you.

00:34:44.240 --> 00:34:45.800 line:0%
I'll give you two options.

00:34:45.950 --> 00:34:46.760 line:0%
Either

00:34:47.050 --> 00:34:48.600 line:0%
gamble with me

00:34:48.760 --> 00:34:50.560 line:0%
and return the money you've won,

00:34:50.920 --> 00:34:52.800 line:0%
or keep the money

00:34:52.950 --> 00:34:53.640 line:0%
but leave

00:34:53.640 --> 00:34:55.160 line:0%
a part of yourselves behind.

00:34:55.160 --> 00:34:55.920 line:0%
Pick one.

00:34:56.430 --> 00:34:57.760 line:0%
I don't choose either of the options

00:34:57.760 --> 00:34:58.680 line:0%
you mentioned.

00:34:59.000 --> 00:35:01.200 line:0%
I want both the money and my body intact!

00:35:03.160 --> 00:35:05.290 line:0%
Then there's nothing left to discuss.

00:35:09.400 --> 00:35:10.200 line:0%
Boss,

00:35:10.200 --> 00:35:11.640 line:0%
someone outside wants to see you.

00:35:11.640 --> 00:35:12.640 line:0%
I'm busy right now.

00:35:12.640 --> 00:35:13.360 line:0%
Send them away.

00:35:13.360 --> 00:35:14.760 line:0%
Among them is the Prefectural Governor of Yingzhou,

00:35:14.760 --> 00:35:15.640 line:0%
Lord Mo.

00:35:19.800 --> 00:35:20.920 line:0%
Keep an eye on them.

00:35:27.280 --> 00:35:28.080 line:0%
Get away.

00:35:58.560 --> 00:35:59.560 line:0%
Grand Commander.

00:36:00.280 --> 00:36:01.080 line:0%
Take him away.

00:36:01.080 --> 00:36:01.960 line:0%
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:36:02.000 --> 00:36:02.800 line:0%
Go!

00:36:02.980 --> 00:36:04.310 line:0%
Move. Behave yourself!

00:36:05.240 --> 00:36:06.040 line:0%
Hurry up!

00:36:15.650 --> 00:36:16.780 line:0%
This is outrageous.

00:36:16.820 --> 00:36:17.760 line:0%
How dare someone

00:36:17.760 --> 00:36:19.260 line:0%
run a gambling den

00:36:19.290 --> 00:36:20.240 line:0%
right under my nose

00:36:20.240 --> 00:36:21.240 line:0%
and play tricks?

00:36:21.840 --> 00:36:23.040 line:0%
It was only after reviewing the case files

00:36:23.040 --> 00:36:23.880 line:0%
that I found out

00:36:23.880 --> 00:36:25.480 line:0%
Ji Dafu's wife, Li Xiulian,

00:36:25.480 --> 00:36:26.160 line:0%
was the victim of

00:36:26.160 --> 00:36:27.680 line:0%
a brutal rape and murder case

00:36:27.680 --> 00:36:28.400 line:0%
years ago,

00:36:28.400 --> 00:36:29.280 line:0%
and the culprit

00:36:29.280 --> 00:36:30.720 line:0%
was due to her brother Li Kaixiang,

00:36:30.720 --> 00:36:32.240 line:0%
who failed to repay his loan.

00:36:32.240 --> 00:36:33.000 line:0%
The headless corpse case

00:36:33.000 --> 00:36:34.640 line:0%
is likely that Ji Dafu killed Li Kaixiang to avenge his wife,

00:36:34.640 --> 00:36:35.720 line:0%
using the Half-faced Ghost

00:36:35.720 --> 00:36:36.800 line:0%
rumors as a cover.

00:36:36.880 --> 00:36:38.080 line:0%
Does Ji Dafu

00:36:38.520 --> 00:36:40.450 line:0%
have any respect for the law at all?

00:36:40.840 --> 00:36:41.800 line:0%
Such a villain,

00:36:41.840 --> 00:36:43.080 line:0%
and we let him escape.

00:36:43.840 --> 00:36:44.400 line:0%
Guards!

00:36:44.400 --> 00:36:46.630 line:0%
Everything went too smoothly.

00:36:47.360 --> 00:36:48.320 line:0%
Issue the order.

00:36:48.440 --> 00:36:49.920 line:0%
Search the entire city for Ji Dafu!

00:36:49.920 --> 00:36:50.720 line:0%
Yes, sir.

00:36:57.200 --> 00:36:58.120 line:0%
Grand Commander,

00:36:58.120 --> 00:36:58.980 line:0%
Secretary Yan,

00:36:59.000 --> 00:36:59.800 line:0%
today

00:36:59.840 --> 00:37:02.240 line:0%
I must thank you for venturing into the gambling den,

00:37:02.240 --> 00:37:03.760 line:0%
which allowed us to crack this case.

00:37:03.760 --> 00:37:05.490 line:0%
You two should rest well today.

00:37:05.600 --> 00:37:06.730 line:0%
Leave the rest to me.

00:37:06.840 --> 00:37:07.640 line:0%
Trust me,

00:37:07.680 --> 00:37:09.480 line:0%
I will surely apprehend Ji Dafu

00:37:09.560 --> 00:37:10.690 line:0%
as soon as possible.

00:37:20.730 --> 00:37:25.930 line:0%
[East City Gate]

00:37:26.020 --> 00:37:28.630 line:0%
[Auspiciousness and Good Luck]

00:38:10.500 --> 00:38:11.560 line:0%
Half-faced Ghost?

00:38:28.330 --> 00:38:29.260 line:0%
[Pure Winds, Auspicious Air]

00:38:46.000 --> 00:38:48.830 line:0%
[Fortune and Prosperity]

00:38:58.410 --> 00:39:00.540 line:0%
I can't believe that bastard got away.

00:39:02.560 --> 00:39:03.360 line:0%
Shen Du.

00:39:14.870 --> 00:39:16.290 line:0%
Kill me.

00:39:17.140 --> 00:39:18.570 line:0%
His limbs and meridians were severed,

00:39:18.570 --> 00:39:19.900 line:0%
and his face was flayed.

00:39:19.910 --> 00:39:21.300 line:0%
To do all this in such a short time,

00:39:21.300 --> 00:39:23.080 line:0%
the culprit must be a seasoned criminal.

00:39:23.080 --> 00:39:23.880 line:0%
What's wrong?

00:39:23.910 --> 00:39:25.090 line:0%
What happened?

00:39:26.260 --> 00:39:27.950 line:0%
Bi Qiu has lost too much blood.

00:39:28.080 --> 00:39:29.600 line:0%
I'm afraid he...

00:39:29.740 --> 00:39:30.540 line:0%
Bi Qiu!

00:39:30.740 --> 00:39:31.730 line:0%
What happened?

00:39:31.800 --> 00:39:33.000 line:0%
What's going on here?

00:39:33.910 --> 00:39:34.970 line:0%
Half-faced Ghost.

00:39:35.080 --> 00:39:37.150 line:0%
It was the Half-faced Ghost, wasn't it?

00:39:37.150 --> 00:39:39.610 line:0%
I will not rest until I have my revenge on you!

00:39:39.920 --> 00:39:41.480 line:0%
Why did you do this to my subordinate?

00:39:41.480 --> 00:39:42.320 line:0%
Come at me!

00:39:42.320 --> 00:39:43.160 line:0%
Come at me!

00:39:43.160 --> 00:39:43.920 line:0%
Governor Mo,

00:39:44.640 --> 00:39:45.760 line:0%
please calm down first.

00:39:45.760 --> 00:39:47.420 line:0%
Did you see the killer's face?

00:39:56.130 --> 00:39:57.260 line:0%
-Bi Qiu.
-Please...

00:39:57.350 --> 00:39:58.610 line:0%
What do you want to say?

00:40:01.790 --> 00:40:02.950 line:0%
Please...

00:40:05.130 --> 00:40:07.360 line:0%
Give me a quick death.

00:40:08.710 --> 00:40:09.660 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:40:10.230 --> 00:40:11.310 line:0%
Shen Du!

00:40:19.450 --> 00:40:23.250 line:0%
[Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:40:35.080 --> 00:40:37.510 line:0%
End this quickly for me.

00:40:54.020 --> 00:40:55.750 line:0%
Thank you.

00:41:00.640 --> 00:41:01.440 line:0%
Bi Qiu,

00:41:02.080 --> 00:41:03.000 line:0%
rest assured,

00:41:04.040 --> 00:41:05.480 line:0%
I will treat your family

00:41:05.980 --> 00:41:07.350 line:0%
as my own.

00:41:09.580 --> 00:41:12.950 line:0%
[Uphold Virtue Selflessly]

00:41:18.800 --> 00:41:20.060 line:0%
Don't blame yourself.

00:41:21.720 --> 00:41:23.000 line:0%
There is no end

00:41:23.890 --> 00:41:25.370 line:0%
to the evil in this world.

00:41:28.650 --> 00:41:30.750 line:0%
I know that.

00:41:32.000 --> 00:41:32.800 line:0%
It's just...

00:41:44.330 --> 00:41:46.000 line:0%
You can't bear to see it

00:41:47.090 --> 00:41:48.560 line:0%
with your own eyes.

00:41:52.040 --> 00:41:52.880 line:0%
Don't watch it.